    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "able to take a lot of punishment (of a boxer, etc.)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "その若きボクサーは打たれ強く、最後のラウンドまで諦めなかった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "打たれ強い体質のおかげで、彼は重い一撃にも動じなかった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "プロボクサーに求められるのは技術だけでなく打たれ強さである。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "核攻撃を受けて通信線の一部が途絶えても、全面的なコミュニケーションの途絶に陥らないよう備えた、網の目状の〈打たれ強い〉通信網が原点だったと言うのです。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "本の未来",
                "author": "富田倫生",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その際、網の目状のシステムには打たれ強い性格があると強調されたことは事実です。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "本の未来",
                "author": "富田倫生",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "able to keep one's cool when the batter gets a hit (of a baseball pitcher)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "このベテラン投手は打たれ強く、いかなる状況でも心を乱さない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "打たれ強い性格だからこそ、彼は逆転試合で活躍できるのだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その投手は長年の経験から打たれ強い姿勢を身に付けていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "resilient",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "失敗しても打たれ強い彼は、すぐに立ち直って次に進む。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "打たれ強い精神力があれば、どんな困難でも乗り越えられる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "人生経験から彼女は打たれ強い性格になっていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
